  "description": "Kyutai STT is a decoder-only Transformer designed for streaming automatic speech recognition (ASR), outputting transcripts as audio becomes available rather than waiting for the full recording. The platform offers two versions: a ~1B parameter model supporting English and French with a 0.5s delay, and a ~2.6B parameter English-only model with a 2.5s delay. Both models leverage Mimi tokenization and operate at 12.5 Hz frame rates, producing transcripts with capitalization and punctuation under a CC-BY 4.0 license.",
